WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:04,920
why are you so early

2
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:05,920
I'm still going to buy groceries

3
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,320
You came so early, right?

4
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:08,220
I have something urgent to do

5
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:10,320
I said give the iron horse back to you first

6
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:11,820
You call him Tie Ma Xing

7
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:13,220
Just call it whatever you like.

8
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,020
Tell me if you have anything urgent to do.

9
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:19,220
I'm going to buy medicine. What medicine should I buy for wind and cold?

10
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:20,420
Isn't it just a cold?

11
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:23,220
Is it your child who has a cold? No, no, it’s not my child.

12
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:24,220
I don’t have kids yet

13
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,420
It's a kid I know

14
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:26,820
Five of them caught the cold together

15
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:27,820
What are the symptoms

16
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:29,220
Just a high fever that won’t go away

17
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:31,220
I'll take you to the pharmacy

18
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:32,620
Are you buying herbal medicine?

19
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:33,620
What herbs should I buy?

20
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:34,920
Of course, medicine is prescribed

21
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:35,920
introduce yourself

22
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:37,420
I'm a doctor at our hospital here

23
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:38,720
And he's a pediatrician

24
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:40,720
Your kids must have the flu

25
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:45,020
I'm going to buy you special flu medicine now. Doctor, right?

26
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,120
You can also call me doctor

27
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:51,810
And it specializes in treating children. Come on, I'll take you to the pharmacy.

28
00:00:51,810 --> 00:00:54,010
These are the special medicines for treating influenza

29
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:56,010
One is a fever-reducing medicine, that's it

30
00:00:56,010 --> 00:00:57,910
How to take this medicine? Does it depend on Allah?

31
00:00:57,910 --> 00:00:58,810
What Allah?

32
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:00,410
Just drink water and swallow these directly
